{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"屯門鳴琴路巴士相撞　九人受傷\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TA-TM-261022-10.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】屯門有兩輛巴士相撞，九人受傷。</p><p>兩名巴士司機及其中一名乘客，分別由救護員陪同登上救護車。警方早上八時許接報，一輛九巴在屯門鳴琴路近山景邨對開，懷疑收掣不及撞向前面一輛切線的另一輛九巴。兩名巴士司機以及七名巴士乘客受傷，要送院治理。現場交通一度受阻。</p><p></p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:33.699626+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T02:04:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:57:55.646706+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:10.524662+00:00","content_hash":"e4d89b5dc652782559f60569a91bfb143bf6fc2ec54837b639b55528328b6f55","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:33.699626+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}